            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A vacuum adiabatic body includes: a first plate member; a second plate member; a sealing part; a supporting unit; a heat resistance unit; and an exhaust port, wherein the heat resistance unit includes a conductive resistance sheet connected to the first plate member, the conductive resistance sheet resisting heat conduction flowing along a wall for the third space, the conductive resistance sheet includes a shielding part for heat-insulating the conductive resistance sheet by shielding one surface of the conductive resistance sheet, and the other surface of the conductive resistance sheet is heat-insulated by the third space.</p>
            </abstract>
